Placeholder

- @claims: Choose powers permanently allocated to CHP.
- @concessions: Choose powers permanently allocated to the partner.
- @sign: Sign the agreement, leaving all other yellow powers unresolved.
- @ministries: Reconsider the ministry distribution.
- @reject: End the negotiations.

@claims
subtitle: CHP powers: [+ {! return AnatolianCoalitions.counts(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights).player; !} +]; partner powers: [+ {! return AnatolianCoalitions.counts(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights).partner; !} +]. Equal numbers are required; unselected powers remain unresolved.
title: Powers Allocated to CHP
new-page: true

= Powers Allocated to CHP

Placeholder

- @player_list_4: Begin the rural concentration efforts. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-4"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_5: Spread the Köykent settlements across Anatolia. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-5"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_6: Increase funding for the Köykent settlements. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-6"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_7: Purchase and redistribute land. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-7"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_8: Support cooperative formation. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-8"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_9: Re-legalize Poppy cultivation. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-9"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_10: Implement price controls to control the inflation. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-10"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_11: Reach out to the global market for debt. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-11"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_12: Initiate public works programs. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-12"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_13: Implement restrictions on the import of commercial goods to decrease the flow of foreign currency outwards. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-13"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_14: Incentivize Turkish companies through subsidies to sell their goods abroad and bring in fresh cash. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-14"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_15: Reform the inefficient state corporations. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-15"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_16: Go on a standby with the IMF. Though we absolutely despise getting into dialogue with the international capitalists, the rampant inflation has left us no choice. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-16"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_17: Devalue the Turkish Lira to finally complete the transformation from an import substitute economy to an export economy. Our base and the unions are firmly against such a course of action. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-17"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_18: Devalue the Turkish Lira to finally complete the transformation from an import substitute economy to an export economy. Our base and the unions are firmly against such a course of action. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-18"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_19: Reform the curriculum. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-19"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_20: Create adult education centers: Halk Eğitim. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-20"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_21: Form student councils in universities and enable student representation. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-21"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_22: Loosen restrictions on the teachers' freedom of expression in classrooms. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-22"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_23: Expand education opportunities in the Köykents. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-23"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_24: Increase scholarship and boarding school opportunities. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-24"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_25: Cut funding to religious İmam Hatip schools. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-25"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_26: Increase educational broadcasts from the state radio, TRT. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-26"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_27: Finance greater accessibility to arts and sports opportunities. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-27"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_28: Open more schools, especially in our isolated rural provinces. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-28"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_29: Reform the tax brackets for different income levels. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-29"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_30: Restrict speculative loans. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-30"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_32: Temporarily freeze the funds of government agencies. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-32"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_33: Borrow loans from the treasury. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-33"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_34: Borrow domestic loans. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-34"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_35: Increase inspections of tax payments. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-35"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_36: Increase taxes on the rich. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-36"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_37: Increase overall taxes. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-37"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_38: Cut overall taxes. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-38"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_39: Make the tax system more progressive by raising taxes on the rich and cutting them for the poor. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-39"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_40: Shift taxes from wealthy households to poorer households [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-40"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_41: Raise tariffs on luxury products. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-41"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_42: Raise general tariffs [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-42"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_43: Lower general tariffs [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-43"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_44: Improve relations with the United States. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-44"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_45: Improve relations with Western Europe. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-45"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_46: Negotiate the Güneş Plan for the creation of a confederation in Cyprus with the US. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-46"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_47: Negotiate the Denktaş Plan for the creation of a confederation in Cyprus with the US. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-47"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_48: Apply to join the European Economic Community, EEC! [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-48"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_49: As a reaction to the arms embargo, close the American bases in our soil! [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-49"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_50: Improve relations with the Soviet Union. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-50"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_51: Sign a treaty of Turkish-Soviet Friendship. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-51"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_52: Borrow loans from the Soviet Union. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-52"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_53: Sign a treaty of economic cooperation. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-53"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_54: Export agricultural products to the Eastern Bloc. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-54"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_55: Purchase oil from Romania. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-55"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_56: Improve relations with the Arabian States. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-56"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_57: Foster trade with the Arabian States. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-57"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_58: Increase economic ties with the Pan-Arabists. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-58"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_59: Arrange sanctions-bypassing trade with Pan-Arab states [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-59"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_60: Increase economic ties with the Gulf Monarchies. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-60"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_61: Negotiate labour migration agreements with Gulf states [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-61"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_62: Form official relations with the Palestine Liberation Organization, PLO. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-62"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_63: Basic industrialization push. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-63"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_64: Divert industrial production away from consumer goods and towards capital and assembly products. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-64"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_65: Move towards high-tech products with great margins of profit such as electronics. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-65"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_66: Employ workers at the maximum level in the state-owned enterprises, KİTs. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-66"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_67: Concentrate small and medium-sized enterprises into cooperatives. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-67"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_68: Shift beneficial loans towards exporting big industry. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-68"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @player_list_69: Restart investment for railway construction. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-69"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
