subtitle: CHP powers: [+ {! return AnatolianCoalitions.counts(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights).player; !} +]; partner powers: [+ {! return AnatolianCoalitions.counts(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights).partner; !} +]. Equal numbers are required; unselected powers remain unresolved.
