= Powers Allocated to the Coalition Partner

Placeholder

- @partner_list_4: Begin the rural concentration efforts. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-4"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_5: Spread the Köykent settlements across Anatolia. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-5"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_6: Increase funding for the Köykent settlements. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-6"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_7: Purchase and redistribute land. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-7"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_8: Support cooperative formation. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-8"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_9: Re-legalize Poppy cultivation. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-9"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_10: Implement price controls to control the inflation. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-10"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_11: Reach out to the global market for debt. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-11"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_12: Initiate public works programs. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-12"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_13: Implement restrictions on the import of commercial goods to decrease the flow of foreign currency outwards. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-13"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_14: Incentivize Turkish companies through subsidies to sell their goods abroad and bring in fresh cash. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-14"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_15: Reform the inefficient state corporations. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-15"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_16: Go on a standby with the IMF. Though we absolutely despise getting into dialogue with the international capitalists, the rampant inflation has left us no choice. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-16"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_17: Devalue the Turkish Lira to finally complete the transformation from an import substitute economy to an export economy. Our base and the unions are firmly against such a course of action. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-17"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_18: Devalue the Turkish Lira to finally complete the transformation from an import substitute economy to an export economy. Our base and the unions are firmly against such a course of action. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-18"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_19: Reform the curriculum. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-19"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_20: Create adult education centers: Halk Eğitim. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-20"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_21: Form student councils in universities and enable student representation. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-21"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_22: Loosen restrictions on the teachers' freedom of expression in classrooms. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-22"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_23: Expand education opportunities in the Köykents. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-23"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_24: Increase scholarship and boarding school opportunities. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-24"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_25: Cut funding to religious İmam Hatip schools. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-25"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_26: Increase educational broadcasts from the state radio, TRT. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-26"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_27: Finance greater accessibility to arts and sports opportunities. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-27"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_28: Open more schools, especially in our isolated rural provinces. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-28"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_29: Reform the tax brackets for different income levels. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-29"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_30: Restrict speculative loans. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-30"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_32: Temporarily freeze the funds of government agencies. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-32"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_33: Borrow loans from the treasury. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-33"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_34: Borrow domestic loans. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-34"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_35: Increase inspections of tax payments. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-35"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_36: Increase taxes on the rich. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-36"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_37: Increase overall taxes. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-37"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_38: Cut overall taxes. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-38"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_39: Make the tax system more progressive by raising taxes on the rich and cutting them for the poor. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-39"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_40: Shift taxes from wealthy households to poorer households [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-40"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_41: Raise tariffs on luxury products. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-41"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_42: Raise general tariffs [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-42"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_43: Lower general tariffs [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-43"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_44: Improve relations with the United States. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-44"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_45: Improve relations with Western Europe. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-45"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_46: Negotiate the Güneş Plan for the creation of a confederation in Cyprus with the US. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-46"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_47: Negotiate the Denktaş Plan for the creation of a confederation in Cyprus with the US. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-47"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_48: Apply to join the European Economic Community, EEC! [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-48"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_49: As a reaction to the arms embargo, close the American bases in our soil! [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-49"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_50: Improve relations with the Soviet Union. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-50"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_51: Sign a treaty of Turkish-Soviet Friendship. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-51"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_52: Borrow loans from the Soviet Union. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-52"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_53: Sign a treaty of economic cooperation. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-53"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_54: Export agricultural products to the Eastern Bloc. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-54"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_55: Purchase oil from Romania. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-55"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_56: Improve relations with the Arabian States. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-56"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_57: Foster trade with the Arabian States. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-57"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_58: Increase economic ties with the Pan-Arabists. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-58"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_59: Arrange sanctions-bypassing trade with Pan-Arab states [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-59"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_60: Increase economic ties with the Gulf Monarchies. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-60"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_61: Negotiate labour migration agreements with Gulf states [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-61"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_62: Form official relations with the Palestine Liberation Organization, PLO. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-62"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_63: Basic industrialization push. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-63"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_64: Divert industrial production away from consumer goods and towards capital and assembly products. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-64"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_65: Move towards high-tech products with great margins of profit such as electronics. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-65"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_66: Employ workers at the maximum level in the state-owned enterprises, KİTs. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-66"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_67: Concentrate small and medium-sized enterprises into cooperatives. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-67"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_68: Shift beneficial loans towards exporting big industry. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-68"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_69: Restart investment for railway construction. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-69"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_70: Promote local industries in the Köykents. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-70"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_71: Launch a general amnesty. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-71"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_72: Release a circular note of moderation in political cases. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-72"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_73: Prioritize the investigation of right winger political violence. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-73"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_74: Work on improving the treatment of political prisoners in prisons. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-74"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_75: Investigate accusations of police violence and torture. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-75"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_76: Resist against DGM, the state security courts. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-76"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_77: Bring the DGMs to the constitutional court! [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-77"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_78: Persecute the anti communist KMD which has been used as a tool of fearmongering against moderate leftists for a long time. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-78"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_81: Implement a system of collective bargaining in major industries. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-81"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_82: Implement Workplace Democracy in state companies, KİTs, through worker advisory representatives. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-82"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_83: Partially legalize secondary strikes. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-83"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_84: Make health inspections in large factories mandatory. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-84"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_86: Increase legal protections for syndicate representatives. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-86"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_87: Ramp up workplace inspections. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-87"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_88: Ease the conditions for the recognition of syndicates for negotiations [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-88"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_89: Expand the Social Security Institution, SSK. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-89"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_90: Launch a programme of state employment. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-90"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_92: Remove the right to lock out workers. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-92"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_95: Increase state support for the officers' investment fund, OYAK. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-95"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_96: Open investigations on the spending of the OYAK funds. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-96"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_98: Launch a campaign of inspections into the financial spending of the military. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-98"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_99: Modernize army factories. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-99"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_100: Form ASELSAN. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-100"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_101: Switch MKE deliveries towards internal production. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-101"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
