- @partner_list_103: Import military equipment directly from the West. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-103"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_104: Improve the loyalty of the Interior Ministry forces. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-104"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_105: Recruit more police forces. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-105"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
