- @partner_list_107: Investigate illegal activity among the far right. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-107"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_110: Clamp down on organized crime in the East. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-110"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_111: Declare OHAL(state of emergency) to put an end to the street fighting. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-111"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_113: Legalize abortions on request, which used to be outlawed, until the 10th week of pregnancy. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-113"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_114: Extend the availability of abortions on request by offering them in all state-owned hospitals. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-114"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_116: Announce directives for establishing equal pay for equal work, regardless of gender. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-116"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_117: Standardize paid maternity leaves. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-117"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_118: Work on extending the standardized maternity leaves from 16 weeks to 24 weeks. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-118"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_119: Extend the maternity leaves to 24 weeks. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-119"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_120: Move to include housewives, housemaids and servants in the social security network. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-120"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_122: Reform MEYAK [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-122"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_123: Found İYAK [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-123"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
