- @partner_list_131: Agricultural efforts [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-131"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_132: Remove administrative and legal obstacles to Kurdish citizens forming and organizing Kurdish associations. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-132"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_133: Lift restrictions on discussing the Kurdish Issue in the public sphere. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-133"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_134: Grant legal permission for regulated Kurdish printing and publishing activities. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-134"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_135: Ease restrictions on the right to hold meetings and demonstrations. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-135"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_136: Strengthen protection and oversight against unlawful violence by public officials and security forces. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-136"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_137: Found the Office of Sectarian Affairs [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-137"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_139: Start admitting women to positions as preachers and professors of Islamic jurisprudence. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-139"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_140: Increase the recruitment of women for positions as preachers and instructors of Islamic jurisprudence. [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-140"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
- @partner_list_141: Bring Religious Affairs Publications into Compliance with the Laws of the Republic [+ {! return "["+(Q.coalition_formation.pending.rights["list-141"]||"unresolved")+"]"; !} +]
